Output .github/assets/demo.gif
Require breath

Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set MarginFill "#0D1117"
Set TypingSpeed 20ms

Type "breath start --theme catppuccin-mocha --font ansiShadow --breathing 5s --recovery 3s --rounds 1"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Type "s"
Sleep 3s
Type "q"
